---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import avatar from '../assets/avatar.jpg';
import Contact from '../components/Contact.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page title="About Rizky — morizkay" description="Meet Moh. Rizky Kay, a software developer based in Palu, Indonesia, working on developer tools, interfaces, and local software.">
  <header class="page-heading">
    <span class="eyebrow">BEHIND THE HANDLE</span>
    <h1>A little<br /><em>about me.</em></h1>
    <p>Rizky in person. morizkay on the internet.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="about-layout">
    <aside class="profile-panel" aria-label="Profile">
      <Image src={avatar} width={400} height={400} alt={`Portrait of ${profile.name}`} loading="eager" />
      <div class="profile-caption">
        <h2>{profile.name}</h2>
        <p>@{profile.handle}</p>
        <div class="profile-details"><Icon name="globe" size={16} /><span>{profile.location}</span></div>
      </div>
    </aside>
    <div class="about-story">
      <span class="eyebrow">HELLO, I’M RIZKY</span>
      <h2>Curiosity,<br /><em>put into code.</em></h2>
      <p>I’m {profile.name}, a software developer based in {profile.location}. I build developer tools, interfaces, and software that makes everyday workflows a little easier.</p>
      <p>I’m currently at Tictag and maintain <a href="https://github.com/efektif">Efektif</a>, a collection of React components, hooks, and shared design tokens, with primitives for React Native.</p>
      <p>My personal projects range from a self-hosted AI gateway to a dashboard for local agent sessions. They’re a way to explore how software fits into the tools we already use, and how those tools can work better together.</p>
      <div class="about-links">
        <a class="text-link" href={profile.github}>Find me on GitHub <Icon name="arrow" size={18} /></a>
        <a class="text-link" href={profile.linkedin}>Connect on LinkedIn <Icon name="arrow" size={18} /></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="interests-section" aria-labelledby="interests-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">THREADS THROUGH MY WORK</span><h2 id="interests-title">What keeps me <em>curious.</em></h2></div></div>
    <div class="interest-grid">
      <article class="interest-card"><Icon name="sliders" size={26} /><h3>Interfaces</h3><p>Useful components, considered details, and design systems that make the next thing easier to build.</p></article>
      <article class="interest-card"><Icon name="terminal" size={26} /><h3>Developer tools</h3><p>Small improvements to everyday workflows, from local development to working with AI agents.</p></article>
      <article class="interest-card"><Icon name="code" size={26} /><h3>Local software</h3><p>Tools that run close to the work, with room to inspect, adapt, and make them your own.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Contact />
</Page>
